-- the axiomatic form on the two-byte store (byte values in {0 , 1 , 2}): its events are per
-- byte and it has no axiom that a store's bytes reach memory together, so it also allows the
-- torn reads 1 and 512 (see Limits in archive/2026-11-11/G-memmodel.md)
by-dom : List Word
by-dom = cons #0 (cons #1 (cons #2 nil))
